      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Selector for getName() indicating the formal currency symbol.</para>
          <para>The formal currency symbol is similar to the regular currency symbol, but it always takes the form used in formal settings such as banking; for example, "NT$" instead of "$" for TWD in zh-TW.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/icu/util/Currency#FORMAL_SYMBOL_NAME" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.icu.util.Currency.FORMAL_SYMBOL_NAME</code>.</a></format></para>
